# Docker build context: an allowlist.
#
# Only one image builds from the repo root: fedac/native/Dockerfile.builder,
# the AC Native OS builder (oven/native-builder.mjs passes this directory as
# the context). session-server builds from its own directory, so nothing here
# affects it.
#
# Dockerfile.builder ends in `COPY . /repo`, and that layer is re-tarred,
# exported and unpacked on every commit — with a denylist it was 2.43 GB and
# 3–8 minutes of every oven build before compiling began. So: deny everything,
# then allow only what docker-build.sh reads:
#   fedac/native/**                                the OS itself
#   system/public/aesthetic.computer/lib, dep      KidLisp + FPS esbuild bundles
#                                                  (inputs checked with --metafile)
#   system/public/aesthetic.computer/disks         web pieces copied into the image
#   system/public/install-firmware.sh              the offline firmware updater
#   xbox/live/{oskiewar,lan-test}.js, ComicRelief  scripts/bundle-oskiewar.sh
# If the build starts reading something new, add it here — a missing path
# fails the copy step loudly, but the esbuild bundles end in `|| true`, so
# check their "bytes" log lines after changing this list.

*
!fedac/native
!system/public/aesthetic.computer/lib
!system/public/aesthetic.computer/dep
!system/public/aesthetic.computer/disks
!system/public/install-firmware.sh
# scripts/bundle-oskiewar.sh: the shared game, its LAN test, and the font.
!xbox/live/oskiewar.js
!xbox/live/lan-test.js
!system/public/papers.aesthetic.computer/foundry/fonts/ComicRelief-Regular.ttf

# Generated or reinstalled inside the allowed trees.
fedac/native/build
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
